    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When <strong>Riley</strong> stumbles across a mysterious portal in her backyard, she\u2019s transported to <strong>Nekojima</strong>\u2014a mystical world teetering on the edge of collapse. Inhabited by feline-like beings called <strong>Cates</strong>. Three tyrannical World Lords now rule the once peaceful land. Guided by a strange talking frog named <strong>Ben</strong>, Riley must fight to restore balance, uncover the truth, and find a way back home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master your moves and push your limits!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your moveset and learn new tools to overcome increasingly difficult obstacles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay levels against a timer, or go up against new and more challenging areas once you've beaten a level!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reconnect a fractured world.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse across three different provinces to free the trapped cates, and build a new home.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden pages that slowly reveal the secrets of a world lost to time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When <strong>Riley</strong> stumbles across a mysterious portal in her backyard, she\u2019s transported to <strong>Nekojima</strong>\u2014a mystical world teetering on the edge of collapse. Inhabited by feline-like beings called <strong>Cates</strong>. Three tyrannical World Lords now rule the once peaceful land. Guided by a strange talking frog named <strong>Ben</strong>, Riley must fight to restore balance, uncover the truth, and find a way back home.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master your moves and push your limits!</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your moveset and learn new tools to overcome increasingly difficult obstacles.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay levels against a timer, or go up against new and more challenging areas once you've beaten a level!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Reconnect a fractured world.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse across three different provinces to free the trapped cates, and build a new home.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover hidden pages that slowly reveal the secrets of a world lost to time.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
